  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2wMZKZ7B6E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/735938861636780042?style=flat-square&logo=discord&label=Discord&color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcozary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-Ko--fi-F16061?style=flat-square&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> • <a href=\"https://github.com/Cozary/Nameless-Trinkets/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Cozary/Nameless-Trinkets?style=flat-square&logo=github&logoColor=white&color=364763\" alt=\"Issues\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fnameless-trinkets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/nameless-trinkets/localized.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1lib5AY.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>關於</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">正在尋找能添加強力飾品的模組嗎？本模組為遊戲增添了多種多樣的飾品，每個飾品都擁有不同的能力，會根據情境或你的遊玩風格發揮效用。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FHlewK2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>在探索世界時，你可以在結構自然生成的箱子中找到飾品！或者你也可以自己製作它們！</em></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media0.giphy.com/media/M6fEiWDG1m1Mjgpri4/giphy.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">按住 Shift 鍵查看物品即可看到飾品賦予的能力。這裡至少有 25 款以上擁有獨特能力的飾品！你還在等什麼？趕快來尋找所有飾品吧！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OT2aoh8.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hr7S7mp.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>部分飾品靈感來自一款優秀的遊戲《以撒的結合》（The Binding of Isaac）。這源於我之前的另一個專案，當時我想將該遊戲中的飾品引入進來。</em></span></p>",
